      },
      "message": "Clarify that V is compatible with Zfinx\n\nThe V extension is compatible with Zfinx [1], but the current spec language\nindicating that it depends on F contradicts that.  This PR resolves that\ncontradiction by allowing V to depend on either F or Zfinx, etc.\n\nThe longer-term and more elegant solution is to declare ISAs with Zfinx\nto be distinct base ISAs. The band-aid in this PR is compatible with the\nlong-term plan.\n\n[1] https://github.com/riscv/riscv-isa-manual/blob/5b8f8d6c04b515e633023deecca49de855f452d2/src/v-st-ext.adoc#L941",
